# Trivy ignore list - accepted risks for the StockSense images.
#
# Rules for adding an entry:
#   1. One CVE per line, with a comment above it: WHY it is accepted, WHO
#      accepted it, and WHEN it must be re-reviewed.
#   2. Only for findings that do not affect this app or have no fix yet.
#   3. Never add something just to turn the gate green.
#
# Example:
# # CVE-YYYY-NNNNN - <pkg>, only reachable via <feature> the app never calls.
# # Accepted by Ridaa Mirza 2026-10-07, review by 2026-11-07.
